      660        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      661        SIZE 39.25 BY 9.33.
      662   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-7
      663        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      664        SIZE 28.63 BY 7.92.
      665   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-8
